# Deep Agent no longer uses .env for LLM / sandbox settings.
# First launch opens a Setup screen; prefs are saved as:
#   {data_dir}/settings.json   (platforms, models, sandbox)
#   {data_dir}/secrets.json    (API keys)
#
# Desktop data dir: %APPDATA%\DeepAgent  (or DEEPAGENT_DATA_DIR)
# Dev data dir: ./data when DEEPAGENT_DATA_DIR is unset (non-desktop)
#
# Optional process env (CI / packaging only):
# DEEPAGENT_DESKTOP=1
# DEEPAGENT_DATA_DIR=./data
# DEEPAGENT_WORKDIR=./workspace
# DEEPAGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=stub
#
# Legacy .env keys are migrated once into settings.json on startup, then ignored
# for provider/base URL/model/key. Prefer the in-app Setup / Settings UI.
